\par  A. C\'f4ng t\'e1c k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n:
\par  Ban qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd x\u7893\'3f s\u7889\'3f ki\u7871\'3fn thi\u7871\'3f}{\f38\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12287727\charrsid12064061 t \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12287727\charrsid12064061 \u7883\'3f}{\f46\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12287727\charrsid12064061 a ph\'fd
