\f46\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12287727\charrsid12064061 \'f0\'fd}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12287727\charrsid12064061 \u7907\'3fc B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh ban h\'e0nh (quy\u7871\'3f}{\f38\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12287727\charrsid12064061 t \'f0}{
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12287727\charrsid12064061 \u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 30-TC/XS ng\'e0y 13/1/1984).
\par  1. Nh\u7919\'3fng kho\u7843\'3fn thu v\u7873\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fp v\u7909\'3f ph\'e1t h\'e0nh x\u7893\'3f s\u7889\'3f ki\u7871\'3fn thi\u7871\'3ft:
\par  1.1 Doanh thu ph\'e1t h\'e0nh x\u7893\'3f s\u7889\'3f (ti\u7873\'3fn thu v\u7873\'3f b\'e1n v\'e9 x\u7893\'3f s\u7889\'3f)
