 s\u7889\'3f (n\u7871\'3fu c\'f3).
\par  1.3 Thu kh\'e1c (thu v\u7873\'3f b\'e1n cu\u7889\'3fng v\'e9, gi\u7845\'3fy v\u7909\'3fn, ph\u7871\'3f li\u7879\'3fu, ph\u7871\'3f ph\u7849\'3fm, l\'e3i su\u7845\'3ft ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7917\'3fi ng\'e2n h\'e0ng...)
\par  2. Nh\u7919\'3fng kho\u7843\'3fn chi v\u7873\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fp v\u7909\'3f ph\'e1t h\'e0nh x\u7893\'3f s\u7889\'3f ki\u7871\'3fn thi\u7871\'3ft:
\par  2.1 Chi tr\u7843\'3f}{\f46\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12287727\charrsid12064061  th\'fd}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12287727\charrsid12064061 \u7903\'3f}{\f38\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12287727\charrsid12064061 ng: Theo qui \'f0}{
