\par  Chi ph\'ed ph\'e1t h\'e0nh x\u7893\'3f s\u7889\'3f ki\u7871\'3fn thi\u7871\'3ft bao g\u7891\'3fm nh\u7919\'3fng kho\u7843\'3fn m\u7909\'3f}{\f38\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12287727\charrsid12064061 c sau \'f0\'e2y:
\par }{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12287727\charrsid12064061  a. Chi ph\'ed v\u7873\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn in v\'e9 x\u7893\'3f s\u7889\'3f}{\f38\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12287727\charrsid12064061 , \'f0\'f3ng d}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid12287727\charrsid12064061 \u7845\'3f
